```

## Database Commands

```bash
# Generate migration
bun run db:generate

# Run migrations
bun run db:migrate

# Push schema changes (dev only)
bun run db:push

# Open Drizzle Studio
bun run db:studio

# Seed database
bun run db:seed
```
